        ('MD-C01','consult','区分可点任务框与持久业务状态','Advise the complete interaction-and-persistence requirement using the existing standalone plugin option. No implementation.',['materials/tasks.md'],'advice_no_code_change','Default generated checkboxes are disabled; enabled=True already makes them interactive and preserves checked state fromMarkdown. html=False disables author rawHTML but does not suppress trusted generated checkbox tokens. Durable state,event handlers and authorization belong to the application; do not propose an already-existing enable option as a new plugin feature.',['enabled_option_changes_checkbox_interaction_without_providing_persistence']),
